    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brewers is a chaotic potion crafting game, where you and up to 3 friends are tasked to defend a castle by brewing up potions with various effects. Potions can affect your units, enemies or spawn new units and what ingredient you use affects what a potion does when it is deployed.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brewers is a chaotic potion crafting game, where you and up to 3 friends are tasked to defend a castle by brewing up potions with various effects. Potions can affect your units, enemies or spawn new units and what ingredient you use affects what a potion does when it is deployed.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Battle Brewers is a 1-4 player couch party game where you are in charge of brewing potions to defend the castle that has hired you and your crew. Brew potions that apply buffs, deal damage or spawn in new units, all to keep the castle afloat from the incoming waves of enemy troops.",
